mes>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Trewavas</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Knight</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oxidative signals in tobacco increase cytosolic calcium</article-title><source>Plant Cell</source><year>1996</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>1301</fpage><lpage>1310</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12244272</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1105/tpc.6.9.1301</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beligni</surname><given-names>MV</given-names></name><name><surname>Lamattina</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Is nitric oxide toxic or protective?</article-title><source>Trends in Plant Sci</source><year>1999</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>299</fpage><lpage>300</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10431217</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1360-1385(99)01451-X</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><fig position="float" id="F1"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Cytosolic calcium response of <italic>Arabidopsis </italic>seedlings under action of oxidative stress induced by H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub></p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2229-5-S1-S20-1"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F2"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Effect of NOR-1 pretreatment on [Ca<sup>2+</sup>]<sub>cyt </sub>response induced by oxidative stress</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2229-5-S1-S20-2"/></fig></sec></back></article>